Site: Prairie Corridor Business Park PV (PXA-2024-0343), feeder ALN-088, 13.2 kV. Issued in writing under
DPS-07 §5.5; not to be altered in the field without a written revision order. Basis: SIS-2025-006 conditions 4.1,
4.3 and 4.5.
Recloser: Norstead Power Controls, distribution-class, three-phase, with control NPC-38, firmware R4.07. CT
ratio 200:5; VTs 7200:120 V, both sides of the interrupter.
